Package: dailoios-update-suite
Version: 1.0.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DaiLoiOS <support@dailoios.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, dpkg, dailoios-center (>= 1.1.2)
Conflicts: dailoios-disable-mintupdate, dailoios-update-replacement, dailoios-update-notifier
Replaces: dailoios-disable-mintupdate, dailoios-update-replacement, dailoios-update-notifier
Description: Complete DaiLoiOS update tray and notifier
 Disables all known Linux Mint Update Manager autostart entries,
 replaces Mint menu launchers with DaiLoi System Update,
 and provides a DaiLoiOS tray icon and update notifications.
